      "sourceTextSha256": "5367239588815c06d9d1971945dbbd182d44d2d10346092c7a722a5d406124c5",
      "text": "Day 12 · After breakfast, discover Rio with our guide: green hills, blue sky, rocky mountains, beautiful bays and beaches, in Brazil’s second most populous city. Excursion to Sugar Loaf (4 hours): a cable car takes you up to Urca Hill, the stop between ground level and the summit, for a cocktail or a taste of Brazilian specialities. From the top of Sugar Loaf, Copacabana Beach stretches away to the left, with the Two Brothers and Gávea mountains on the horizon; below lies Red Beach, and to the right Guanabara Bay, Niterói, Botafogo and the centre, beneath the silhouette of Christ the Redeemer.",
